#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:6
msgid "# Database Design"
msgstr "# 数据库设计"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:9
msgid ""
"> PostgreSQL storage layer. **Slice A** (conversation archive), **Slice B** "
"(`semantic_memory` + `limbic_memory`), **Slice C** (self layer + "
"autobiographical) are live; standalone `procedural` table not yet created "
"(procedural memory currently uses `semantic_memory.type=procedural`).  > "
"Related: [`compression.md`](../concepts/compression.md), [`memory.md`](../"
"concepts/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md)."
msgstr ""
"> PostgreSQL 存储层。**Slice A**（对话存档）、**Slice B**（`semantic_memory` "
"+ `limbic_memory`）、**Slice C**（自我层 + 自传体）已落地；独立 `procedural` "
"表尚未建（程序记忆现用 `semantic_memory.type=procedural`）。 > 关联："
"[`compression.md`](compression.md)、[`memory.md`](memory.md)、[`sleep.md`]"
"(sleep.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:11
msgid "## Status"
msgstr "## 状态"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Phase       | Scope                                                                               | Status                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Slice A** | `sessions` + `messages` (conversation primary PG store)                             | **✅ Complete**                                          |\n"
"| **Slice B** | `semantic_memory`, `limbic_memory`                                                  | **✅ Complete** (standalone procedural table: Issue #41) |\n"
"| **Slice C** | `self_blocks` + `autobiographical_memory` (self layer + autobiographical narrative) | **✅ Complete**                                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 阶段        | 范围                                                           | 状态                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Slice A** | `sessions` + `messages`（对话主存 PG）                         | **✅ 已完成**                                   |\n"
"| **Slice B** | `semantic_memory`、`limbic_memory`                             | **✅ 已完成**（独立 procedural 表见 Issue #41） |\n"
"| **Slice C** | `self_blocks` + `autobiographical_memory`（自我层 + 自传叙事） | **✅ 已完成**                                   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:19
msgid ""
"Code source of truth: [`engine/db/src/schema/`](../../engine/db/src/schema/)."
msgstr "代码真相源：[`engine/db/src/schema/`](../engine/db/src/schema/)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:21
msgid "## PG Multi-Domain Architecture (Path C)"
msgstr "## PG 多域架构（路径 C）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package                          | Responsibility                                                                                   |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-db`           | PG table DDL, migrations, JSONB storage Zod and Slice A **domain types** (`schema/` + `domain/`) |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-repos`        | `SessionStorePort`, `PgRepositories` and other **ports**; `null*` adapters                       |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-conversation` | Session runtime; re-exports `engine-db/domain` convenience types                                 |\n"
"| `@freeanima/connectors-db-pg`    | `PgSessionStore` implementation, connection pool, mapper, repos                                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 包                               | 职责                                                                                  |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-db`           | PG 表 DDL、migration、JSONB 存储 Zod 与 Slice A **领域类型**（`schema/` + `domain/`） |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-repos`        | `SessionStorePort`、`PgRepositories` 等仓储**端口**；`null*` 适配器                   |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-conversation` | 会话运行时；re-export `engine-db/domain` 便利类型                                     |\n"
"| `@freeanima/connectors-db-pg`    | `PgSessionStore` 实现、连接池、mapper、repo                                           |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:30
msgid ""
"Wiring: [`service/service/src/serve.ts`](../../service/service/src/serve.ts) "
"calls `createPgRepositories` → `createEngine({ repos })` → "
"`createConversationService(engine.repos)` → `initServiceContext`. Runtime "
"conversation archive reads/writes via `getServiceContext().conversation` or "
"explicit `ConversationService` / `SessionStorePort`, not direct connector "
"dependency."
msgstr ""
"装配：[`service/service/src/serve.ts`](../service/service/src/serve.ts) 调用 "
"`createPgRepositories` → `createEngine({ repos })` → "
"`createConversationService(engine.repos)` → `initServiceContext`。运行时对话"
"存档读写经 `getServiceContext().conversation` 或显式 `ConversationService` / "
"`SessionStorePort`，不直接依赖 connector。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:32
msgid ""
"New PG domain (memory / cron / task): `engine-db/schema/{domain}` → add port "
"in `engine-repos` → implement in `connectors-db-pg` → extend "
"`PgRepositories` fields → wire in `serve.ts`."
msgstr ""
"新增 PG 域（memory / cron / task）：`engine-db/schema/{domain}` → `engine-"
"repos` 增端口 → `connectors-db-pg` 实现 → `PgRepositories` 扩展字段 → "
"`serve.ts` 装配。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:36
msgid "## Slice A: Session (2 Tables)"
msgstr "## Slice A：Session（2 表）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:38
msgid "### Design Principles"
msgstr "### 设计原则"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
msgid ""
"`sessions` **one row = `session_meta`** (compression, todos, clarify, tools, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""
"`sessions` **一行 = `session_meta`**（含 compression、todos、clarify、tools "
"等）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
msgid ""
"`messages` **append-only**; `payload` JSONB stores `MessagePayload` (no "
"`pos`); `pos` column is per-session sequence source of truth"
msgstr ""
"`messages` **只追加**；`payload` JSONB 存 `MessagePayload`（无 `pos`）；"
"`pos` 列是会话内序号真相源"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
msgid ""
"**Storage Zod authoritative in `engine-db/schema`**; domain convenience "
"types in `engine-db/domain` (`engine-conversation` re-exports)"
msgstr ""
"**存储 Zod 以 `engine-db/schema` 为准**；领域便利类型见 `engine-db/domain`"
"（`engine-conversation` re-export）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
msgid ""
"Drizzle manages DDL + migration; `sessions` still columnizes common meta "
"fields"
msgstr "Drizzle 管 DDL + migration；`sessions` 仍列化常用 meta 字段"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
msgid ""
"Read/write: `connectors-db-pg` mapper (`pos` column + payload merged into "
"`ConversationMessage`)"
msgstr ""
"读写：`connectors-db-pg` mapper（`pos` 列 + payload 合并为 "
"`ConversationMessage`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:46 docs/guide/database.md:148
#: docs/guide/database.md:264
msgid "### Table Structure"
msgstr "### 表结构"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:48
msgid "#### `sessions`"
msgstr "#### `sessions`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column             | Type          | Description                                                                                               |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`               | TEXT PK       | Session name                                                                                              |\n"
"| `model`            | TEXT NOT NULL |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `title`            | TEXT          |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `cwd`              | TEXT          |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `system_prompt`    | TEXT          |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `platform_info`    | JSONB         | `discriminatedUnion(\"platform\")`: parlor / discord / weixin / studio-pair-programming / cron              |\n"
"| `compression`      | JSONB         | `{ l2, l3, summary?, summary_at? }` — **compression boundaries** (see [`compression.md`](compression.md)) |\n"
"| `todos`            | JSONB         | `{ items, next_id }`                                                                                      |\n"
"| `awaiting_clarify` | JSONB         | clarify pause state                                                                                       |\n"
"| `acp_sessions`     | JSONB         | ACP session uuid mapping                                                                                  |\n"
"| `tools`            | JSONB         | OpenAI tools snapshot                                                                                     |\n"
"| `functions`        | JSONB         | string[]                                                                                                  |\n"
"| `debug`            | BOOLEAN       |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `created_at`       | TIMESTAMPTZ   |                                                                                                           |\n"
"| `updated_at`       | TIMESTAMPTZ   |                                                                                                           |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:68
msgid "#### `messages`"
msgstr "#### `messages`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column              | Type                  | Description                                                                                  |\n"
"| ------------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`                | TEXT PK               | Globally unique row id (UUID)                                                                |\n"
"| `session_id`        | TEXT FK → sessions.id |                                                                                              |\n"
"| `pos`               | BIGINT                | Monotonic per-session sequence (compression l2/l3 point here; domain `Message.pos`)          |\n"
"| `payload`           | JSONB                 | `ConversationPayload` (role/content/tool_calls etc., **no pos**)                             |\n"
"| `fts_segmented`     | TEXT (nullable)       | jieba segmented string; written when `cjk.enabled`; `content_fts` prefers non-empty value    |\n"
"| `content_fts`       | TSVECTOR (generated)  | STORED; indexes segmented string when `fts_segmented` set, else `message_fts_input(content)` |\n"
"| `content_embedding` | VECTOR(1024)          | Conversation content embedding; async write when `embedding` configured                      |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 列                  | 类型                  | 说明                                                                           |\n"
"| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `id`                | TEXT PK               | 全局唯一行 id（UUID）                                                          |\n"
"| `session_id`        | TEXT FK → sessions.id |                                                                                |\n"
"| `pos`               | BIGINT                | 会话内单调序号（compression l2/l3 指向此值；领域层 `Message.pos`）             |\n"
"| `payload`           | JSONB                 | `ConversationPayload`（role/content/tool_calls 等，**不含 pos**）              |\n"
"| `fts_segmented`     | TEXT（可空）          | jieba 分词串；`cjk.enabled` 时写入；`content_fts` 优先使用非空值               |\n"
"| `content_fts`       | TSVECTOR（生成列）    | STORED；有 `fts_segmented` 时直接索引分词串，否则 `message_fts_input(content)` |\n"
"| `content_embedding` | VECTOR(1024)          | 对话 content embedding；配置 `embedding` 后异步写入                            |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:80
msgid "Unique index: `(session_id, pos)`."
msgstr "唯一索引：`(session_id, pos)`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:82
msgid ""
"Full-text indexes: `messages_content_fts_gin` (GIN on `content_fts`), "
"`idx_messages_content_trgm` (GIN trgm on `payload->>'content'`), "
"`idx_messages_embedding_hnsw` (HNSW cosine). For `recall` historical "
"conversation retrieval; filter excludes tool messages and empty content. "
"Retrieval: **FTS + pg_trgm + pgvector three-way RRF** (always on; vector "
"path requires `embedding` config and non-null column)."
msgstr ""
"全文索引：`messages_content_fts_gin`（GIN on `content_fts`）、"
"`idx_messages_content_trgm`（GIN trgm on `payload->>'content'`）、"
"`idx_messages_embedding_hnsw`（HNSW cosine）。供 `recall` 历史对话检索；过滤"
"规则：排除 tool 消息与空 content。检索为 **FTS + pg_trgm + pgvector 三路 "
"RRF**（常开；向量路需 `embedding` 配置且列非空）。"

