#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Driver:** `Bun.sql` + `drizzle-orm/bun-sql/postgres` (`connectors/db-pg`).\n"
msgstr "**驱动**：`Bun.sql` + `drizzle-orm/bun-sql/postgres`（`connectors/db-pg`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Upstream patch:** rc.3 bun-sql driver default `tagged=true` causes incomplete SQL from RQB `.select()` ([drizzle#5802](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/issues/5802)); repo uses Bun `patchedDependencies` with [`patches/drizzle-orm@1.0.0-rc.3.patch`](../../patches/drizzle-orm@1.0.0-rc.3.patch) (equivalent to [PR#5824](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/pull/5824): `tagged=false`). After patch, CRUD read path uses Drizzle RQB; FTS / complex retrieval still uses `execute`. Patch removable when upstream merges and releases. Regression: `tests/integration/db/db-session.test.ts`.\n"
msgstr "**上游补丁**：rc.3 的 bun-sql 驱动默认 `tagged=true` 会导致 RQB `.select()` 生成残缺 SQL（[drizzle#5802](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/issues/5802)）；仓库用 Bun `patchedDependencies` 打 [`patches/drizzle-orm@1.0.0-rc.3.patch`](../patches/drizzle-orm@1.0.0-rc.3.patch)（等同 [PR#5824](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/pull/5824)：`tagged=false`）。补丁生效后 CRUD 读路径用 Drizzle RQB；FTS / 复杂检索仍用 `execute`。上游合并发版后可删补丁。回归见 `tests/integration/db/db-session.test.ts`。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:98
msgid "### Migrations"
msgstr "### 迁移"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:102
msgid ""
"**✅ Production:** On `anima service` startup with PG as primary store, "
"[`serve.ts`](../../service/service/src/serve.ts) auto-calls "
"`runMigrations()`."
msgstr ""
"**✅ 生产**：`anima service` 启动且 PG 为主存时，[`serve.ts`](../service/"
"service/src/serve.ts) 自动调用 `runMigrations()`。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:102
msgid ""
"**Manual:** `bun run --filter @freeanima/engine-db db:migrate` — applies "
"Drizzle migrations (including columnized → payload JSONB backfill)."
msgstr ""
"**手动**：`bun run --filter @freeanima/engine-db db:migrate` — 应用 Drizzle "
"migration（含列化 → payload JSONB 的数据回填）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:102
msgid ""
"**Extensions (one-time, requires superuser):** `pg_trgm` / `vector` cannot "
"be `CREATE EXTENSION` by app user. On local Debian, [`setup-postgres-"
"debian.sh`](../../scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh) installs automatically; "
"for existing DB:"
msgstr ""
"**扩展（一次性，须 superuser）**：`pg_trgm` / `vector` 不能由应用用户 "
"`CREATE EXTENSION`。本机 Debian 用 [`setup-postgres-debian.sh`](../scripts/"
"setup-postgres-debian.sh) 会自动安装；已有库请执行："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # version matches psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f engine/db/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # 版本号与 psql --version 一致\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f engine/db/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:109
msgid "Then `db:migrate` or restart `anima service`."
msgstr "然后再 `db:migrate` 或重启 `anima service`。"

