#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:146
msgid "## Slice B: semantic_memory (Live)"
msgstr "## Slice B：semantic_memory（已落地）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:165
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column              | Type                 | Description                                                                                                                  |\n"
"| ------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`                | TEXT PK              | Retains `f-{seq}-{hex}` format                                                                                               |\n"
"| `type`              | TEXT                 | `world/experience/opinion/observation/preference/procedural/imprint`                                                         |\n"
"| `pinned`            | BOOLEAN              | Priority inject into resident memory                                                                                         |\n"
"| `content`           | TEXT                 | Memory body                                                                                                                  |\n"
"| `fts_segmented`     | TEXT (nullable)      | jieba segmented string; written when `cjk.enabled`                                                                           |\n"
"| `content_fts`       | TSVECTOR (generated) | Indexes segmented string when set, else `message_fts_input(content)` STORED                                                  |\n"
"| `content_embedding` | VECTOR(1024)         | bge-m3 etc. embedding; async when `config.embedding` set; WebUI rebuild can backfill                                         |\n"
"| `source_sessions`   | TEXT[]               | Source session ID list, default `'{}'`                                                                                       |\n"
"| `observed_at`       | TIMESTAMPTZ          | First observation time; legacy rows backfilled from `created`                                                                |\n"
"| `occurred_at`       | TEXT                 | Fuzzy occurrence time in fact content                                                                                        |\n"
"| `status`            | TEXT                 | `active` / `deprecated`, default `active`                                                                                    |\n"
"| `reference_count`   | REAL                 | Reference weight sum after per-session dedup + 30-day time decay; `builtin-memory-reference-sync` recalculates from messages |\n"
"| `created`           | TIMESTAMPTZ          |                                                                                                                              |\n"
"| `updated`           | TIMESTAMPTZ          |                                                                                                                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:167
msgid "### `memory_references` (Semantic Memory References)"
msgstr "### `memory_references`（语义记忆引用）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:169
msgid ""
"`[记忆 #f-000001-abcd]` markers in message body persisted; invalidated on "
"session / message delete cascade."
msgstr ""
"消息正文中的 `[记忆 #f-000001-abcd]` 标记持久化；session / message 删除时级联"
"作废。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:177
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column               | Type        | Description                                |\n"
"| -------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `id`                 | UUID PK     |                                            |\n"
"| `message_id`         | TEXT FK     | → `messages.id` ON DELETE CASCADE          |\n"
"| `semantic_memory_id` | TEXT FK     | → `semantic_memory.id` ON DELETE CASCADE   |\n"
"| `session_id`         | TEXT FK     | → `sessions.id` ON DELETE CASCADE          |\n"
"| `created_at`         | TIMESTAMPTZ | Reference time (usually message timestamp) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 列                   | 类型        | 说明                                     |\n"
"| -------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`                 | UUID PK     |                                          |\n"
"| `message_id`         | TEXT FK     | → `messages.id` ON DELETE CASCADE        |\n"
"| `semantic_memory_id` | TEXT FK     | → `semantic_memory.id` ON DELETE CASCADE |\n"
"| `session_id`         | TEXT FK     | → `sessions.id` ON DELETE CASCADE        |\n"
"| `created_at`         | TIMESTAMPTZ | 引用时间（通常取 message timestamp）     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:179
msgid ""
"Unique index: `(message_id, semantic_memory_id)`. Same memory cited multiple "
"times in one session counts once for weight; references within 30 days "
"weight ×2."
msgstr ""
"唯一索引：`(message_id, semantic_memory_id)`。同一 session 内同记忆多次引用仅"
"计一次权重；30 天内引用权重 ×2。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:181
msgid ""
"Port: `MemoryReferenceStorePort` (`engine-repos`) → `PgMemoryReferenceStore` "
"(`connectors-db-pg`); incremental on `appendMessage`; cron `builtin-memory-"
"reference-sync` full rebuild and calibrates `reference_count`."
msgstr ""
"端口：`MemoryReferenceStorePort`（`engine-repos`）→ `PgMemoryReferenceStore`"
"（`connectors-db-pg`）；`appendMessage` 增量写入；cron `builtin-memory-"
"reference-sync` 从 messages 全量重建并校准 `reference_count`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:183
msgid ""
"Indexes: `idx_semantic_memory_fts` (GIN), `idx_semantic_memory_content_trgm` "
"(GIN trgm), `idx_semantic_memory_embedding_hnsw` (HNSW cosine), "
"`idx_semantic_memory_type`, `idx_semantic_memory_pinned`, "
"`idx_semantic_memory_source_sessions` (GIN), `idx_semantic_memory_status`. "
"Retrieval: **FTS + pg_trgm + pgvector three-way RRF** (always on; vector "
"path requires `embedding` config and non-null column)."
msgstr ""
"索引：`idx_semantic_memory_fts`（GIN）、`idx_semantic_memory_content_trgm`"
"（GIN trgm）、`idx_semantic_memory_embedding_hnsw`（HNSW cosine）、"
"`idx_semantic_memory_type`、`idx_semantic_memory_pinned`、"
"`idx_semantic_memory_source_sessions`（GIN）、`idx_semantic_memory_status`。"
"检索为 **FTS + pg_trgm + pgvector 三路 RRF**（常开；向量路需 `embedding` 配置"
"且列非空）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:185
msgid ""
"Port methods: `create` / `update` (overwrite, omitted fields unchanged; "
"`source_sessions: []` clears) / `deprecate` / `listBySourceSessions` / "
"`search` / `searchFts`; `listResident` = **all pinned** + **reference_count "
"top N** (default N=20, `status=active` only)."
msgstr ""
"端口方法：`create` / `update`（覆盖式，未传不变；`source_sessions: []` 可清"
"空）/ `deprecate` / `listBySourceSessions` / `search` / `searchFts`；"
"`listResident` = **pinned 全量** + **reference_count top N**（默认 N=20，仅 "
"`status=active`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:187
msgid ""
"Port: `SemanticMemoryStorePort` (`engine-repos`) → `PgSemanticMemoryStore` "
"(`connectors-db-pg`) → `registerSemanticMemoryStore` (`life-memory`)."
msgstr ""
"端口：`SemanticMemoryStorePort`（`engine-repos`）→ `PgSemanticMemoryStore`"
"（`connectors-db-pg`）→ `registerSemanticMemoryStore`（`life-memory`）。"

