#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:298
msgid "## cron_log (Live)"
msgstr "## cron_log（已落地）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:300
msgid ""
"One row appended per cron run end (success and failure); WebUI `/chamber/"
"sleep` and `GET /api/cron-logs` query this table. `cron/output/*.txt` "
"retained as debug copies."
msgstr ""
"Cron 每次运行结束追加一行（成功与失败均记录）；WebUI `/chamber/sleep` 与 "
"`GET /api/cron-logs` 查询此表。`cron/output/*.txt` 仍保留作调试副本。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:311
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column        | Type        | Description                                                                |\n"
"| ------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`          | BIGINT PK   | Auto-increment                                                             |\n"
"| `job_id`      | TEXT FK     | → `cron_jobs.id` ON DELETE CASCADE                                         |\n"
"| `run_count`   | INTEGER     | Matches run's `cron_jobs.run_count`                                        |\n"
"| `ok`          | BOOLEAN     | Success                                                                    |\n"
"| `finished_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | End time                                                                   |\n"
"| `output`      | JSONB       | Written when success and parseable as JSON (e.g. light/deep sleep results) |\n"
"| `output_text` | TEXT        | Truncated raw text for non-JSON success                                    |\n"
"| `error`       | TEXT        | Failure error summary (truncated ~2KB)                                     |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 列            | 类型        | 说明                                          |\n"
"| ------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`          | BIGINT PK   | 自增                                          |\n"
"| `job_id`      | TEXT FK     | → `cron_jobs.id` ON DELETE CASCADE            |\n"
"| `run_count`   | INTEGER     | 与当次 `cron_jobs.run_count` 一致             |\n"
"| `ok`          | BOOLEAN     | 是否成功                                      |\n"
"| `finished_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | 结束时间                                      |\n"
"| `output`      | JSONB       | 成功且可解析为 JSON 时写入（如浅睡/深睡结果） |\n"
"| `output_text` | TEXT        | 非 JSON 成功输出截断原文                      |\n"
"| `error`       | TEXT        | 失败错误摘要（截断 ~2KB）                     |\n"

